<title>USA: Accustaff Inc Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>Accustaff Inc Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited Financial Highlights</p>
<p>		 (in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p> Operating Highlights:			   1997	    1996</p>
<p> Revenue					  $477,226     $279,032</p>
<p> Gross profit				    115,081	 62,162</p>
<p> Income from operations			 36,822	 14,496</p>
<p>Income before provision for income taxes</p>
<p>							34,857	 12,313</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		   13,420	  4,287</p>
<p> Net income					 21,437	  8,026</p>
<p> Pro forma net income (1)		     21,437	  7,571</p>
<p>Pro forma earnings per common</p>
<p>   and common share equivalents		 0.21	   0.09</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding     108,304	 81,277</p>
<p>NOTE: All periods presented reflect the poolings with Career Horizons Inc, HJM Consulting Inc, McKinley Group Inc, and PTA International.</p>
<p>All share and per share amounts have been adjusted to reflect the three-for-one stock split effective March 29, 1996.</p>
<p>(1) Pro forma net income reflects a pro forma provision for income taxes for acquired companies accounted for as a pooling of interest which were S-corporations in previous periods.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
